Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Luca Nenna attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 18, "text": "I'm happy to help!"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 19, "end": 79, "text": "However, I noticed that the provided evidence is incomplete."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 80, "end": 171, "text": "To create a comprehensive Wikipedia entry, I'll need more information to support the claim."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 172, "end": 241, "text": "After conducting research, I found that Luca Nenna received his Ph.D."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 242, "end": 286, "text": "from Université Paris IX - Dauphine in 2016."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 287, "end": 413, "text": "Université Paris IX - Dauphine is one of the constituent universities of PSL University (Paris Sciences & Lettres University)."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 414, "end": 445, "text": "Here's a draft Wikipedia entry:"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 447, "end": 457, "text": "Luca Nenna"}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 459, "end": 508, "text": "Luca Nenna is a researcher who obtained his Ph.D."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 509, "end": 553, "text": "from Université Paris IX - Dauphine in 2016."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 554, "end": 563, "text": "Education"}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 565, "end": 589, "text": "Nenna received his Ph.D."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 590, "end": 665, "text": "from Université Paris IX - Dauphine, a French university in Paris, in 2016."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 666, "end": 744, "text": "[1] At the time, Université Paris IX - Dauphine was an independent university."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 745, "end": 887, "text": "However, in 2010, it became one of the founding members of PSL University (Paris Sciences & Lettres University), a French university in Paris."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 888, "end": 891, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 893, "end": 1017, "text": "As a result, Luca Nenna can be considered an alumnus of PSL University, having attended one of its constituent universities."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1018, "end": 1029, "text": "References:"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1031, "end": 1066, "text": "[1] Université Paris IX - Dauphine."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1067, "end": 1074, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1075, "end": 1088, "text": "PhD Programs."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1089, "end": 1151, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/dauphine.psl.eu\\/en\\/phd-programs\\/>"}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1153, "end": 1172, "text": "[2] PSL University."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1173, "end": 1180, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1181, "end": 1193, "text": "Our History."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1194, "end": 1260, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.univ-psl.fr\\/en\\/about\\/our-history>"}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1262, "end": 1378, "text": "Please note that this entry is based on the available information and might need further verification and expansion."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 151, "text": "As Luca Nenna strolled along the cobblestone streets of Bergen, the misty veil of the Norwegian morning clung to his jacket like a damp lover's caress."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 152, "end": 279, "text": "He had always been drawn to the rugged beauty of this city, where the fjords sliced through the landscape like shards of glass."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 280, "end": 382, "text": "It was here, amidst the whispers of the ancient Viking sagas, that he had discovered his true calling."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 383, "end": 525, "text": "Luca's thoughts drifted back to his days as a graduate student at the University of Bergen, where the windswept campus had been his sanctuary."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 526, "end": 679, "text": "He remembered the countless hours spent pouring over dusty tomes in the library, fueled by steaming cups of kaffe and the occasional plate of kjøttkaker."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 680, "end": 755, "text": "The memories still lingered, like the faint scent of saltwater on his skin."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 756, "end": 841, "text": "Professor Helga Olsen, his thesis advisor, had been a constant source of inspiration."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 842, "end": 964, "text": "Her sharp mind and quick wit had pushed him to challenge his own assumptions, to question the very fabric of his research."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 965, "end": 1089, "text": "Luca recalled the countless debates they had engaged in, their voices rising and falling like the tides of the nearby fjord."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1090, "end": 1182, "text": "As he turned a corner, the imposing façade of the university's main building came into view."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1183, "end": 1351, "text": "Luca's heart swelled with nostalgia, remembering the countless late nights spent typing away in the computer lab, fueled by a steady supply of coffee and determination."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1352, "end": 1413, "text": "It was here, within these walls, that he had earned his Ph.D."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1414, "end": 1509, "text": "from the Université Paris IX - Dauphine, a testament to his unwavering dedication to his craft."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1510, "end": 1581, "text": "The sound of seagulls crying overhead brought Luca back to the present."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1582, "end": 1649, "text": "He smiled to himself, feeling the familiar tug of the city's charm."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c1", "entity": "Luca Nenna", "scope": "Education", "claim": "Luca Nenna can be considered an alumnus of PSL University, having attended one of its constituent universities.", "answer": "PSL University", "quote": "As a result, Luca Nenna can be considered an alumnus of PSL University, having attended one of its constituent universities.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Luca Nenna", "scope": "Graduate student", "claim": "Luca Nenna was a graduate student at the University of Bergen.", "answer": "University of Bergen", "quote": "Luca's thoughts drifted back to his days as a graduate student at the University of Bergen, where the windswept campus had been his sanctuary.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Luca Nenna", "scope": "Ph.D. recipient", "claim": "Luca Nenna earned his Ph.D. from the Université Paris IX - Dauphine.", "answer": "Université Paris IX - Dauphine", "quote": "It was here, within these walls, that he had earned his Ph.D. from the Université Paris IX - Dauphine, a testament to his unwavering dedication to his craft.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers